            "declared_in": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"},
              "description": "model: repo file(s) that declare how this dependency is integrated, e.g. the CMakeLists.txt with find_package/FetchContent_Declare/ExternalProject_Add/target_link_libraries, a .gitmodules entry, or a requirements/manifest line"},
            "used_symbols": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"},
              "description": "model (best-effort, codegraph/grep): the dependency's public symbols / APIs THIS library actually calls (e.g. cairo_create, BIO_new, numpy.ndarray). Consumed by dim-9 bottom-up rollup: a child's un-adaptable API only blocks this (parent) library if it appears here. Omit/empty for system deps or when usage can't be pinned down (rollup then falls back to dependency scope)."},
